WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.450
Introducing. The Shopping Agent on Your Side.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.950
Wednesday. Dad's birthday is Saturday. Gift idea: his morning coffee is the best part of his day. What would he love?

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.950
So many stores. So many tabs and apps.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.450
Just ask your Shopping Agent once. A coffee grinder for Dad's birthday, under $150, here by Saturday. Agent: On it. I'll check the stores you use and come back with one good answer.

5
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:22.450
It checks the stores you already use: marketplaces, retailers and brand stores.

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.950
One good answer, with its reasons. Electric coffee grinder, $129, arrives Friday. From a store you have used four times, every order on time. The price is in line with the last 30 days. 30-day returns, with a gift receipt.

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.450
Your call. Always. It finds and recommends; you make the final call. How much it does is up to you: find options, recommend one, and, only if you turn them on, check out and track delivery and returns. Hand off as much, or as little, as you like.

8
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.450
You say yes. Then it orders. Order Dad's gift? Coffee grinder, $129, arrives Friday. Your card provider approves the payment. Yes, order it.

9
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.950
Done. On its way. Ordered Wednesday, shipped Thursday, delivered Friday.

10
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:49.950
Sunday morning. A message from Dad, with a photo of his morning coffee: Mom and I are enjoying the best coffee in years. Thank you, sweetheart! You: So happy it made your morning, Dad.

11
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:57.450
Finds the perfect gift, for anyone, right on time. Restocks your favourite drink before it runs out. Checks the sale so the discount is real. Waits for your price on the things you want.

12
00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.950
Safe, Fast, Fun!

13
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.950
The Shopping Agent on Your Side. Join Now.
